# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the C++ tests (TSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>).
#
# A reader under the sequence lock copies bytes while a writer may be changing them, then reads the
# sequence again and discards the copy if it moved. The copy is a data race by design, so the
# functions that make it are listed here. Nothing else belongs in this file: a report from any
# other function is a finding.
# The names carry no namespace: the library's is versioned (sharedbox::v3), and a pattern matches any
# part of a frame's function name.
race:detail::copy_checked
race:detail::read_used_impl
race:detail::read_metadata
race:handle::read
race:stream_reader::receive
race:stream_reader::fetch
